      <title>Pulse 0.5.16</title>
      <sparkle:shortVersionString>0.5.16</sparkle:shortVersionString>
      <sparkle:version>24</sparkle:version>
      <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>14.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
      <pubDate>Fri, 09 Oct 2026 12:52:11 +0800</pubDate>
      <description><![CDATA[
        <ul>
          <li>New: Live Feed drives your device from part of the screen in real time, for games, streams or a video in your browser (Control &gt; Live Feed from Screen…)</li>
          <li>Live Feed keeps the stroke going through camera cuts, and can hold a minimum stroke depth and speed (Settings &gt; Live Feed)</li>
          <li>New: Motion Source chooses Scripts Only, Script Else Video Motion, or Video Motion Only (transport bar, Control menu, or the remote)</li>
        </ul>
